{"id": "2024-08-17--meta--facebook--privacy-policy--fbca560", "date": "2024-08-17T12:30:37Z", "platform": "meta", "platform_name": "Meta", "service": "Facebook", "doc_id": "meta--facebook--privacy-policy", "document": "Facebook Privacy Policy", "type": "formatting", "added": 2, "removed": 2, "words_changed": 0, "sections": ["Highlights"], "unstable": false, "declared_dates": ["June 26, 2024"], "source_commit": "https://github.com/OpenTermsArchive/pga-versions/commit/fbca560069b8c86a045877c30c3b834acd0495d5", "hunks": [{"section": "Highlights", "old_start": 46, "new_start": 46, "lead": "In this policy we list the kinds of information we collect. Here are some important ones. We collect:", "lines": [[" ", "* Information from [partners\\[3\\]](#annotation-3) about things you do both on and off of our Products. This could include other websites you visit, apps you use or online games you play."], [" ", ""], ["-", "[Play Video](https://mbasic.facebook.com/video_redirect/?src=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo-fra3-1.xx.fbcdn.net%2Fv%2Ft42.1790-2%2F281467190_173521038391582_2422662776604828979_n.mp4%3F_nc_cat%3D103%26ccb%3D1-7%26_nc_sid%3D55d0d3%26efg%3DeyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InN2ZV9zZCIsInZpZGVvX2lkIjoxMDc4NDg0MTY5NDE1NzU1fQ%253D%253D%26_nc_ohc%3DN7bvfadT1XkQ7kNvgGcanG9%26_nc_ht%3Dvideo-fra3-1.xx%26oh%3D00_AYDicRB47P4Tv-c-PehBv598p1BE82v7sv1gHa78wIGL_w%26oe%3D66C5BDC2&source=misc&id=1078484169415755&noredirect=0&watermark=0&__tn__=F)"], ["+", "[Play Video](https://mbasic.facebook.com/video_redirect/?src=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo-fra3-1.xx.fbcdn.net%2Fv%2Ft42.1790-2%2F281467190_173521038391582_2422662776604828979_n.mp4%3F_nc_cat%3D103%26ccb%3D1-7%26_nc_sid%3D55d0d3%26efg%3DeyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InN2ZV9zZCIsInZpZGVvX2lkIjoxMDc4NDg0MTY5NDE1NzU1fQ%253D%253D%26_nc_ohc%3DN7bvfadT1XkQ7kNvgGcanG9%26_nc_ht%3Dvideo-fra3-1.xx%26oh%3D00_AYA8w7Y-gKXl9umAjsbrTPb1QR72TbL7zn25bEcsqbwBVg%26oe%3D66C66682&source=misc&id=1078484169415755&noredirect=0&watermark=0&__tn__=F)"], [" ", ""], [" ", "The information we collect and process about you depends on how you use our [Products\\[4\\]](#annotation-4). For example, we collect different information if you sell furniture on Marketplace than if you post a reel on Instagram. When you use our Products, we collect some information about you [even if you don't have an account\\[5\\]](#annotation-5)."]]}, {"section": "Highlights", "old_start": 188, "new_start": 188, "lead": "Here are some of the ways we use your information:", "lines": [[" ", "* We research for the good of people around the world, like to advance technology or to help out in a crisis"], [" ", ""], ["-", "[Play Video](https://mbasic.facebook.com/video_redirect/?src=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo-fra3-2.xx.fbcdn.net%2Fv%2Ft42.1790-2%2F279782447_313613587553795_9049993928662872183_n.mp4%3F_nc_cat%3D111%26ccb%3D1-7%26_nc_sid%3D55d0d3%26efg%3DeyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InN2ZV9zZCIsInZpZGVvX2lkIjozMjM0NTA2OTYzNTA1MzA5fQ%253D%253D%26_nc_ohc%3DzKBECptxPz8Q7kNvgGLS6Ri%26_nc_ht%3Dvideo-fra3-2.xx%26oh%3D00_AYDnuTqw_E84QKfHi0pvqNZMr-X-GmYGL28P7c2ef2p0gw%26oe%3D66C5CF44&source=misc&id=3234506963505309&noredirect=0&watermark=0&__tn__=F)"], ["+", "[Play Video](https://mbasic.facebook.com/video_redirect/?src=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo-fra3-2.xx.fbcdn.net%2Fv%2Ft42.1790-2%2F279782447_313613587553795_9049993928662872183_n.mp4%3F_nc_cat%3D111%26ccb%3D1-7%26_nc_sid%3D55d0d3%26efg%3DeyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InN2ZV9zZCIsInZpZGVvX2lkIjozMjM0NTA2OTYzNTA1MzA5fQ%253D%253D%26_nc_ohc%3DzKBECptxPz8Q7kNvgGLS6Ri%26_nc_ht%3Dvideo-fra3-2.xx%26oh%3D00_AYATsuHchZ6OwXKFbPR1irBscuB76XjO9bWoFP1796kOCQ%26oe%3D66C67804&source=misc&id=3234506963505309&noredirect=0&watermark=0&__tn__=F)"], [" ", ""], [" ", "We use [information we collect](#1-WhatInformationDoWe) to provide a personalized experience to you, including ads (if we show you ads on Meta Products), along with the other purposes we explain in detail below."]]}]}